   "install": {
    "title": "Self-Hosting",
    "html": "<p>Deploy your own private prompt library with custom branding, themes, and authentication.</p>\n<p><strong>Quick Start:</strong></p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">npx prompts.chat new my-prompt-library\ncd my-prompt-library\n</code></pre>\n<p><strong>Manual Setup:</strong></p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">git clone https://github.com/f/prompts.chat.git\ncd prompts.chat\nnpm install &amp;&amp; npm run setup\n</code></pre>\n<p>The setup wizard configures branding, theme, authentication (GitHub/Google/Azure AD), and features.</p>\n<p><strong>Recommended database:</strong> prompts.chat uses PostgreSQL. For a hosted database, we recommend <a href=\"https://get.neon.com/VqfnMo4\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Neon</a>.</p>\n<div>\n  <p>Sponsored by</p>\n  <a href=\"https://get.neon.com/VqfnMo4\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n    \n      \n      \n      <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/f/prompts.chat/main/public/sponsors/neon-dark.svg\" alt=\"Neon Logo fallback\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" />\n    \n  </a>\n</div><p>📖 <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/f/prompts.chat/blob/main/SELF-HOSTING.md\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Full Self-Hosting Guide</a></strong> • 🐳 <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/f/prompts.chat/blob/main/DOCKER.md\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Docker Guide</a></strong></p>\n<hr />",
